# Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) for `wrangler dev`. Every value is a `wrangler secret` in production.
# There is NO local identity bypass: requests still need a real Access token in the
# `Cf-Access-Jwt-Assertion` header, verified against your team's live signing keys (README "Local dev").
ACCESS_TEAM_DOMAIN="https://<your-team>.cloudflareaccess.com"
ACCESS_AUD="<the Access application's AUD tag>"
OWNER_EMAILS="<your login email>"
SERVICE_TOKENS='{"<agent-client-id>.access": {"role": "agent", "name": "agent"}}'
